{"id":"nb-001","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"हाँ दीदी, रेखा की बेटी आज तीसरे दिन की है। वजन दो किलो तीन सौ ग्राम है, दूध अच्छे से पी रही है, नाभि सूखी है, कोई मवाद नहीं।","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Rekha","day":3,"weight_g":2300,"feeding":"good","symptoms":{"cord_pus":false}},"flags":["nb_low_weight"],"tags":["filler","numbers-in-words","negation","watch-only"]}
{"id":"nb-002","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"पूजा का बच्चा, पाँचवाँ दिन। पसली चल रही है और दूध नहीं पकड़ रहा। साँस गिनी तो 68 आई एक मिनट में।","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Pooja","day":5,"resp_rate":68,"feeding":"none","symptoms":{"chest_indrawing":true}},"flags":["nb_chest_indrawing","nb_fast_breathing","nb_not_feeding","nb_sepsis_signs"],"tags":["local-idiom","multi-sign","numbers-digits"]}
{"id":"nb-003","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"मीना के बेटे का टेम्परेचर 99 डिग्री है, वजन ढाई किलो, सात दिन का है। दूध ठीक पी रहा है।","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Meena","day":7,"weight_g":2500,"temp_c":37.2,"feeding":"good"},"flags":[],"tags":["fahrenheit","fraction-words","borderline","normal-visit","numbers-digits"]}
{"id":"nb-004","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"बच्चा बहुत सुस्त है, छूने पर ही हिलता है, रोना भी कमज़ोर है। अनीता का बच्चा है, दसवाँ दिन।","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Anita","day":10,"symptoms":{"lethargy":true,"weak_cry":true}},"flags":["nb_lethargy","nb_sepsis_signs","nb_weak_cry"],"tags":["local-idiom","multi-sign","numbers-in-words"]}
{"id":"nb-005","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"सरिता की बेटी को पीलिया है, आँखें पीली हैं, पर हथेली तलवे पीले नहीं हैं। चौथा दिन है। दूध अच्छे से पी रही है।","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Sarita","day":4,"feeding":"good","symptoms":{"jaundice":true,"jaundice_palms_soles":false}},"flags":[],"tags":["negation","local-idiom","normal-visit"]}
{"id":"nb-006","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"सविता का बच्चा पहले दिन का है और अभी से पीला दिख रहा है। वजन दो किलो सौ ग्राम।","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Savita","day":1,"weight_g":2100,"symptoms":{"jaundice":true}},"flags":["nb_jaundice_early","nb_low_weight"],"tags":["borderline","numbers-in-words","local-idiom"]}
{"id":"nb-007","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"टेम्परेचर देखा तो 95 डिग्री आया, बदन ठंडा है। गीता का बच्चा है, वजन डेढ़ किलो, तीसरा दिन।","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Geeta","day":3,"weight_g":1500,"temp_c":35.0,"symptoms":{"cold_to_touch":true}},"flags":["nb_hypothermia","nb_very_low_weight"],"tags":["fahrenheit","fraction-words","multi-sign","numbers-digits"]}
{"id":"nb-008","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"ममता के बच्चे को कल रात झटके आए थे, अब दूध भी कम पी रहा है। चौदह दिन का है।","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Mamta","day":14,"feeding":"poor","symptoms":{"convulsions":true}},"flags":["nb_convulsions","nb_poor_feeding"],"tags":["local-idiom","multi-sign","numbers-in-words"]}
{"id":"nb-009","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"वजन एक किलो आठ सौ ग्राम है, बिल्कुल अठारह सौ। साँस साठ है एक मिनट में, पसली नहीं चल रही। लता का बच्चा, सातवाँ दिन।","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Lata","day":7,"weight_g":1800,"resp_rate":60,"symptoms":{"chest_indrawing":false}},"flags":["nb_fast_breathing","nb_low_weight"],"tags":["borderline","numbers-in-words","negation","local-idiom"]}
{"id":"nb-010","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"अरे दीदी, बच्चे की पॉटी में खून आ रहा है। प्रिया का बेटा है, बारह दिन का। बुखार नहीं है।","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Priya","day":12,"symptoms":{"blood_stool":true,"hot_to_touch":false}},"flags":["nb_blood_stool"],"tags":["filler","negation","local-idiom","numbers-in-words"]}
{"id":"nb-011","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"कविता का बच्चा अट्ठाइसवें दिन का है, वजन तीन किलो दो सौ, दूध अच्छा पी रहा है, रोता भी ज़ोर से है, कोई दिक्कत नहीं।","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Kavita","day":28,"weight_g":3200,"feeding":"good","symptoms":{"weak_cry":false}},"flags":[],"tags":["normal-visit","numbers-in-words","negation"]}
{"id":"nb-012","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"नाभि से मवाद आ रहा है और आसपास लाल है। शबनम का बच्चा, नौ दिन का, दूध ठीक पी रहा है, बदन गरम नहीं।","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Shabnam","day":9,"feeding":"good","symptoms":{"cord_pus":true,"hot_to_touch":false}},"flags":["nb_cord_infection"],"tags":["local-idiom","negation"]}
{"id":"nb-013","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"टेम्परेचर सैंतीस पॉइंट पाँच है। ज्योति का बच्चा, पाँच दिन का, वजन दो किलो छह सौ।","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Jyoti","day":5,"weight_g":2600,"temp_c":37.5},"flags":["nb_fever"],"tags":["celsius","borderline","numbers-in-words"]}
{"id":"nb-014","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"बच्चे की साँस गिनी, पहले 58 आई, फिर दोबारा गिनी तो 64 आई। दीपा का बच्चा है, दसवाँ दिन।","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Deepa","day":10,"resp_rate":64},"flags":["nb_fast_breathing"],"tags":["self-correction","distractor-number","numbers-digits"]}
{"id":"nb-015","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"बच्चा दूध नहीं पी रहा, बिल्कुल नहीं, और बदन भी गरम है। उषा की बेटी, दूसरा दिन।","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Usha","day":2,"feeding":"none","symptoms":{"hot_to_touch":true}},"flags":["nb_fever","nb_not_feeding","nb_sepsis_signs"],"tags":["multi-sign","local-idiom","no-number-fever"]}
{"id":"nb-016","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"राधा के बच्चे की आँख से कीचड़ आ रहा है और गर्दन पे छोटे छोटे दाने हैं, पीप वाले। बाकी दूध ठीक, वजन दो किलो आठ सौ।","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Radha","weight_g":2800,"feeding":"good","symptoms":{"eye_discharge":true,"skin_pustules":true}},"flags":["nb_eye_discharge","nb_skin_pustules"],"tags":["multi-sign","local-idiom","numbers-in-words"]}
{"id":"nb-017","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"वजन... दो किलो चार सौ, नहीं नहीं, दो किलो पाँच सौ बीस ग्राम है। निशा का बच्चा, चौदहवाँ दिन, सब ठीक है।","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Nisha","day":14,"weight_g":2520},"flags":[],"tags":["self-correction","numbers-in-words","normal-visit"]}
{"id":"nb-018","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"बच्चे को बार बार उल्टी हो रही है और दस्त भी, पतली पतली। आरती का बच्चा बीस दिन का है, टेम्परेचर 100 डिग्री।","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Aarti","day":20,"temp_c":37.8,"symptoms":{"vomiting":true,"diarrhoea":true}},"flags":["nb_diarrhoea","nb_fever","nb_sepsis_signs","nb_vomiting"],"tags":["multi-sign","fahrenheit","numbers-digits"]}
{"id":"nb-019","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"माँ को बुखार है लेकिन बच्चा ठीक है, बच्चे का टेम्परेचर 98 डिग्री, दूध पी रहा है अच्छे से। संगीता का बच्चा, सातवाँ दिन।","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Sangeeta","day":7,"temp_c":36.7,"feeding":"good"},"flags":[],"tags":["subject-ambiguity","fahrenheit","normal-visit","numbers-digits"]}
