{"id":"nb-028","lang":"mr","script":"devanagari","said":"सुरेखाचं बाळ सातवा दिवस आहे, वजन दोन किलो तीनशे ग्रॅम, दूध नीट पितं, ताप नाही.","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Surekha","day":7,"weight_g":2300,"feeding":"good","symptoms":{"hot_to_touch":false}},"flags":["nb_low_weight"],"tags":["numbers-in-words","negation","watch-only"]}
{"id":"nb-029","lang":"mr","script":"devanagari","said":"बाळ दूध पीत नाही, अंग थंड पडलंय, आणि खूप शिथिल आहे. वैशालीचं बाळ, दुसरा दिवस.","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Vaishali","day":2,"feeding":"none","symptoms":{"cold_to_touch":true,"lethargy":true}},"flags":["nb_hypothermia","nb_lethargy","nb_not_feeding","nb_sepsis_signs"],"tags":["local-idiom","multi-sign"]}
{"id":"nb-030","lang":"mr","script":"devanagari","said":"मनीषाच्या बाळाचं वजन पावणे दोन किलो आहे, पाचवा दिवस, दूध कमी पितं.","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Manisha","day":5,"weight_g":1750,"feeding":"poor"},"flags":["nb_poor_feeding","nb_very_low_weight"],"tags":["fraction-words","numbers-in-words"]}
{"id":"nb-031","lang":"mr","script":"devanagari","said":"बाळाला आकडी आली सकाळी, आता श्वास पासष्ट आहे मिनिटाला. शीतलचं बाळ, दहा दिवसांचं.","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Sheetal","day":10,"resp_rate":65,"symptoms":{"convulsions":true}},"flags":["nb_convulsions","nb_fast_breathing"],"tags":["local-idiom","numbers-in-words","multi-sign"]}
{"id":"nb-032","lang":"mr","script":"devanagari","said":"नाळेतून पू येतोय, बाकी बाळ नीट आहे, दूध पितं, ताप नाही. अश्विनीचं बाळ, आठवा दिवस.","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Ashwini","day":8,"feeding":"good","symptoms":{"cord_pus":true,"hot_to_touch":false}},"flags":["nb_cord_infection"],"tags":["local-idiom","negation"]}
{"id":"nb-033","lang":"mr","script":"devanagari","said":"बाळाचं तापमान अडतीस पॉइंट दोन आहे, अंग गरम लागतंय. स्वातीचं बाळ, सहावा दिवस, वजन अडीच किलो.","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Swati","day":6,"weight_g":2500,"temp_c":38.2,"symptoms":{"hot_to_touch":true}},"flags":["nb_fever"],"tags":["celsius","numbers-in-words","fraction-words","borderline"]}
{"id":"nb-034","lang":"mr","script":"devanagari","said":"बाळाची छाती आत ओढली जाते, श्वास बासष्ट. रुपालीचं बाळ, तिसरा दिवस, दूध कमी पितं.","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Rupali","day":3,"resp_rate":62,"feeding":"poor","symptoms":{"chest_indrawing":true}},"flags":["nb_chest_indrawing","nb_fast_breathing","nb_poor_feeding","nb_sepsis_signs"],"tags":["local-idiom","multi-sign","numbers-in-words"]}
{"id":"nb-035","lang":"mr","script":"devanagari","said":"हो ताई, प्रतिभाचं बाळ चौदा दिवसांचं, वजन तीन किलो, दूध छान पितं, नाळ सुकली, पू नाही, डोळे स्वच्छ.","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Pratibha","day":14,"weight_g":3000,"feeding":"good","symptoms":{"cord_pus":false,"eye_discharge":false}},"flags":[],"tags":["normal-visit","filler","negation","numbers-in-words"]}
