{"id":"pnc-004","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"बोलने में अटक रही है, उल्टा सीधा बोल रही है, और आँखों से धुंधला दिख रहा है। दो दिन हुए डिलीवरी को। सरला।","record":{"type":"pnc","name":"Sarla","day":2,"symptoms":{"abnormal_speech":true,"blurred_vision":true}},"flags":["pnc_neuro"],"tags":["local-idiom","multi-sign"]}
{"id":"pnc-005","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"दीदी, पैड दिन में पाँच लग रहे हैं, बुखार 99 डिग्री है। मधु, चौथा दिन।","record":{"type":"pnc","name":"Madhu","day":4,"pads":5,"temp_c":37.2,"symptoms":{"fever":true}},"flags":["pnc_fever","pnc_heavy_bleeding"],"tags":["borderline","fahrenheit","filler","numbers-digits"]}
