{"id":"pnc-007","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"साँस फूल रही है लेटे लेटे भी, चेहरे पर सूजन है। सुनीता, सात दिन हुए।","record":{"type":"pnc","name":"Sunita","day":7,"symptoms":{"breathless":true,"swelling_face_hands":true}},"flags":["pnc_breathless","pnc_swelling"],"tags":["multi-sign","local-idiom"]}
